# logs screen-missing ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Inferred from v0.3.2 and origin/main. The Logs screen. web-$
# 01.example.net runs Debian 13, less installed. No file there.$
# origin/main's main() makes it at every start as root, before$
# flags (cmd/hardn/main.go:57; logging.go:38), so today this$
# shows only where that open failed; next/p3-startup moves that$
# write.$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  No log yet$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

